WEBVTT

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:31.281
and engage and work

00:20:31.305 --> 00:20:33.186
within this realm,

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:37.216
and, "What can I do to make myself
be in greater service to this?"

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:40.411
Because I can't think of anything better
as a way to spend my time.

00:20:40.435 --> 00:20:42.955
And I don't need to know
how the ultimate meme ends.

00:20:42.979 --> 00:20:45.276
I don't need to see the endgame.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:50.217
I'm just very happy to be
one of the pieces in this evolving story.

00:20:50.241 --> 00:20:51.645
That's good enough.

00:20:51.669 --> 00:20:54.803
CA: One of the reasons I think
you came to the worldview you did

00:20:54.827 --> 00:20:57.046
was because you've
experienced, in your life,

00:20:57.070 --> 00:21:01.342
these amazing coincidences, shall we say,